SUMMARY:Child Advocacy Network Lunch & Learn: Data in Advocacy
DESCRIPTION:Join NC Child’s Child Advocacy Network for a Data in Advocacy Lunch & Learn on Wednesday\, July 22 at 12pm. The training will explore how data can strengthen our advocacy efforts\, inform decision-making\, and help tell the story of the children\, families\, and communities we serve. This session will highlight the value of data-driven advocacy and provide an opportunity for discussion\, learning\, and collaboration. \nRegister here.
URL:https://resilientdurhamnc.org/event/child-advocacy-network-lunch-learn-data-in-advocacy/
LOCATION:Zoom
END:VEVENT
